{"t":"Dragon Lairs","s":"dragon-lairs-548ea","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Undead_Dragon_a9f752.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Undead Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Undead_Dragon_a9f752.gif\" width=\"64\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p>Dragon Lairs (also called D-Lairs) are places with a large respawn of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon\">Ghastly Dragons</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Dragon\">Undead Dragons</a>. Since those places are mainly Dragon respawns, players started referring to all of those places as Dragon Lairs.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_c599c2.gif\" width=\"64\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p>There are several Dragon Lairs scattered over Tibia, They consist of:<br/>\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchlings</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Hatchling\">Dragon Lord Hatchlings</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore%20Dragon%20Lair\">Venore</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia%20Dragon%20Lair\">Darashia</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel%20Dragon%20Lairs%2FKha%27labal\">Ankrahmun</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Dragon%20Lair\">Edron</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais%20Dragon%20Lair\">Thais</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin%20Dragon%20Lair\">Carlin</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum%2FDragon%20Cave\">Mount Sternum</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon%20Dragon%20Lair\">Kazordoon</a>;</li>\n<li>Plains of Havoc;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno%20Dragon%20Lair\">Pits of Inferno</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goroma%2FDragon%20Lairs\">Goroma</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Foreigner%20Quarter%2FElves\">Crystal Lakes</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fenrock\">Fenrock</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula%20Dungeon\">Fibula</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonblaze%20Peaks\">Dragonblaze Peaks</a> (together with <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragons</a>);</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Razachai\">Razachai</a> Castle (together with <a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Dragon\">Undead Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon\">Ghastly Dragons</a>).</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon%20Hatchling\">Frost Dragon Hatchlings</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Okolnir\">Okolnir</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonblaze%20Peaks\">Dragonblaze Peaks</a> (together with <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>);</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a> (together with <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon\">Ghastly Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Dragon\">Undead Dragons</a>).</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon\">Ghastly Dragons</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Northern <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>'s <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon%20Lair\">Ghastly Dragon Lair</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Corruption%20Hole\">Corruption Hole</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Razachai\">Razachai</a> Castle (together with <a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Dragon\">Undead Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>);</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a> (together with <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Dragon\">Undead Dragons</a>).</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Dragon\">Undead Dragons</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno\">Ashfalor's Throneroom</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Arcanum\">The Arcanum</a>;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Razachai\">Razachai</a> Castle (together with <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon\">Ghastly Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>);</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a> (together with <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon\">Ghastly Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragons</a>).</li></ul>\n<p><b>Note: </b>during April you may find several Dragon's Nests and outrageous amounts of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchlings</a> in some Dragon Lairs. This is due to the event <a href=\"#/quest/spring-into-life\">Spring into Life</a>.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Frost Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Frost_Dragon_4084aa.gif\" width=\"64\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ghastly Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ghastly_Dragon_886f0a.gif\" width=\"64\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>","quests":["spring-into-life"]}